      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding as a comment cause no one should care- I implemented Stickers in another game via modding using Decalery like a week ago and had to make this same distinction with how I named it. I wanted to replicate the fun I had in Little Big Planet, but I originally made the thing to only allow one-per-player due to concerns with networking, vram, and potential abuse & moderation issues- but I also felt the name Stickers was untruthful and that Sprays sounded lame, so I reworked the thing prior to release to allow for multiple \"Sticker Slots\".\n\nI believe that was the correct choice for what I desired. Although, I did not limit how many you could place, only a budget of 4k triangles per player to spend, which has resulted in sticker chaos:",
