  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-09-05T21:32:40.496Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I believe there is a distinction between what is expected from \"Sprays\", which is what you've implemented, and \"Stickers\", which sounds like you can place a multitude of.\n\nSeeing the sharing bubble as well in the developer update, I'd like to assume these features are inspired by games like Little Big Planet. These are amazing features to be implemented but I feel the name is not truthful to what is actually there.\n\nPersonally I believe you should be able to place multiple- but up to a limit.",
